subckt dut (VSS Vout)
Cgd (Vout net1) capacitor c=1p
Cgs (net1 VSS) capacitor c=1p
CL (Vout VSS) capacitor c=1p
G1 (Vout VSS net1 VSS) vccs gm=1m
r0 (Vout VSS) resistor r=1k
Rin (net1 net0) resistor r=20
RL (Vout VSS) resistor r=1k
Vin (net0 VSS) vsource dc=1 mag=20m phase=0
